From: Andrey Skvortsov <andrej.skvortzov@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 30 Sep 2024 23:44:10 +0300
Subject: arm64: dts: allwinner: pinephone: keep power for WiFi in suspend
 mode

rtw88 driver expects, that mmc host is be able to keep power in
suspend mode. Otherwise suspend fails with following errors:

 rtw8723cs mmc0:0001:1: Failed to host PM flag MMC_PM_KEEP_POWER
 rtw8723cs mmc0:0001:1: PM: dpm_run_callback(): pm_generic_suspend returns -22
 rtw8723cs mmc0:0001:1: PM: failed to suspend async: error -22
 PM: Some devices failed to suspend, or early wake event detected

Signed-off-by: Andrey Skvortsov <andrej.skvortzov@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone.dtsi | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone.dtsi
index 22c6b88..01bdb10 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-pinephone.dtsi
@@ -773,6 +773,7 @@ &mmc1 {
 	vqmmc-supply = <&reg_dldo4>;
 	bus-width = <4>;
 	non-removable;
+	keep-power-in-suspend;
 	status = "okay";
 
 	rtl8723cs: wifi@1 {
